# Demo-local build/venv/output artifacts. Only the tour/wild sources,
# render scripts, the rendered PNGs under renders*/ and the UV lane's
# SVG sheet (renders-uv/montage-uv.svg — text, so it diffs) are
# tracked. The UV lane's per-face cells live under out/uv/ and are not:
# there are ~1000 of them, and the sheet is the artifact worth keeping.
# (`out/` matches at any depth, so demos/wild/out/ is covered too.)
tour/target/
wild/target/
out/
.venv/
target-demo/
renders-freecad/*.fail.txt
# out/ already covers the render staging trees (out/stage-renders*/)
# and the per-scene FreeCAD logs; spelled out because they are the
# only place an in-flight pass exists.
out/freecad-logs/
